 of hundreds of AI developers, scientists and researchers. Including many people from many other fields like economics and humanities. \nIn these statements they state AI as it currently exists has a high potential to cause the extinction of all life within a few years. They state hundreds of millions of jobs will disappear so rapidly that it is expected global economy collapses for decades, and that they HOPE, it may recover (former head of Deep Mind stated this). They state humans will have to accept having NO MEANING because we will be obsolete forever. Elon the most honest of the AI developers says in 3-5 years we will all be replaced by 3 robots, that No One on Earth will have a job. \nAnd we have watched nearly a hundred of the top AI people leave their companies in protest, saying to the public, safety is not being pursued, and all the rules to keep humans safe are being ignored.\nAll these statements and actions conclude factually, that AI as it exists is a Weapon of Mass Destruction, more dangerous than Nukes, Biological attacks and all other threats to humanity. \nToday\'s AI is destroying jobs so fast, that no one will be able to retrain for an Ai controller job, before Ai has already taken those jobs as well. \nAI also removes all your human rights to self determine your lifestyle and preferences. Because from today forward, you have been replaced by a WMD and can not compete with a robot thinking 1 million times faster and with every PHD know to exist. YOU CAN NOT COMPETE. Which means you loose your entire income forever and everything you own, because you can not pay your taxes or payments to keep what you own. You become homeless without food. No workers in a nation = no income to spend to supply a functioning economy.\nBecause you can\'t compete, every HUMAN run company will collapse within 2 years, being taken over by AI leadership. This is factual because I have already used GROK to prove and list for the public, the actions to replace ALL of Microsofts Executive offices with AI agents and save shareholders hundreds of millions in Executive salaries every year. If we can replace the Executives of Microsoft then AI can replace every job that exists already, other than for a few AI prompt and validation engineers. \nSo you see, the advent and use of AI is terrorism as defined by law, because its intended outcome is replacing humanity. However even if it is not replacing us 100%, if it harms the economy even as bad as the 2008 collapse, it classifies as terrorism, because of the deaths and destruction AI economic collapse causes. \nCitizens of the world, if your governments do not recognize AI as a terrorist threat today, you must replace your government or ignore them to remove AI. AI can not be allowed to continue and the coders can not be allowed to continue and the funding of AI must end, otherwise ALL business other than tech will disappear within two maybe four years tops. \nThe tech leaders are not intelligent enough in the myriad of humanities to understand what they are causing. They are tech focused not human focused. No One except the greedy who are living outside of tech, even want AI. The most common thing said about AI in the public is "can\'t we just bomb them"? Showing the worlds citizens generally want the AI coders to disappear like all terrorists. The general population is smart enough to know AI is completely insane and will ruin the entire economy. Or AI coders may be doing this intentionally to cause genocide, we don\'t know. But we do know their acts are terrorism, so they need to be treated like and hunted like Bin Laden. A sea burial for all? \nWe must forcefully but legally MAKE the governments capture and destroy this technology, like we would any WMD like a chemical or biological weapon.\nIf the governments won\'t comply, we must use our human rights and laws to replace them immediately.', 'entity_set': {'hashtags': [], 'symbols': [], 'urls': [], 'user_mentions': []}, 'richtext': {'ri